      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091412">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091414">SSE</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091416">Return the bitwise logical OR of packed single precision floating-point values in xmm1 and xmm2/mem. </para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1091418">VEX.128.0F 56 /r</para>
